= Congressional Oversight

With the House in our hands, we can investigate, subpoena, and hold hearings.

- @investigate_abuse: Investigate abuses of power
- @bipartisan_oversight: Pursue bipartisan oversight
- @legislative_agenda: Focus on the legislative agenda
- @easy_discard

@investigate_abuse
on-arrival: institutions += 2; subversion_progress -= 0.6; trump_urgency += 0.4; polarization += 1.5; gop_enthusiasm += 0.5; dem_enthusiasm += 0.4; month_actions += 1

Hearings expose misconduct and energize both sides.

@bipartisan_oversight
on-arrival: institutions += 1.5; gopmod_relation += 5; polarization -= 0.5; progressive_dissent += 3; month_actions += 1

Narrower, bipartisan inquiries command broader respect.

@legislative_agenda
on-arrival: budget += 0; working_dem += 2*(1-dissent); suburban_dem += 1*(1-dissent); progressive_dissent -= 1; month_actions += 1

We spend our time on popular bills, even if the Senate blocks them.
